    "body": "The quick gate passes: 271 unit tests and 37 integration tests.\n\nAll seven directory-suite pins pass. Five behavior pins failed before the fix. All 12 final mutation checks fail and then pass after restoration.\n\nThe required command fails twice:\n`cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n\nBoth runs report `clippy::needless_bool` at `xtask/src/unit_sweep.rs:67`. That file matches upstream/main `6f900b123`. This patch does not change that file.\n\nI stopped under Step 7. The claim is released.\n\nThe local patch remains in `.claude/worktrees/issue-3186` on `issue/3186-directory-suite-selection`. The branch is not pushed. No PR is open.\n\nThe patch changes directory-suite asset selection, catalog selection, ignored-test detection, and quick module filters. No golden file changes.\n\nPR #3162 touches `xtask/src/catalog.rs` in different functions. This patch changes `map_catalog`.\n",
